title: "pyekw"
abstract: "Python library for Polish land registry (eKW, Elektroniczne Księgi Wieczyste) numbers: validate KW numbers, calculate check digits, look up 350+ courts, extract KW numbers from text and suggest corrections. Zero dependencies, typed."
